<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-SMT Health started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-SMT Health started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Rodman &amp; Renshaw Inc said Wednesday it initiated coverage of SMT Health Services Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Rodman in a report said it believes the MRI (magnetic resonance imaging) shared services company can double in size over the next three years by building on its current operational model, increasing its MRI units from the current 18 units to 36.</p>
<p>--Its earnings per share estimates are $0.70 for 1997 and $0.86 for 1998.</p>
<p>--SMT Health was up 5/16 at 8-3/8.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
